WEBVTT

00:01:58.197 --> 00:02:00.908
Seasons getting heated scolding
y'all will be frightful

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.870
You gon’ learn to clean ya room
when you live under my roof

00:02:04.579 --> 00:02:07.373
Kristen Warren:
Blessed creatures fall and die

00:02:07.373 --> 00:02:10.459
Wildfires in their eyes

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:13.379
Stop waiting for a sign

00:02:13.379 --> 00:02:15.840
Please ease your Mother's mind

00:02:15.882 --> 00:02:18.634
In Eden we could be

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:21.804
Take care of you and me

00:02:21.804 --> 00:02:24.682
While waters swell and rise

00:02:24.682 --> 00:02:26.726
Please ease your Mother's mind

00:02:26.767 --> 00:02:27.935
MV: Dear Mother Earth,

00:02:27.935 --> 00:02:29.145
Where do we begin?

00:02:29.145 --> 00:02:31.606
To change all this mess left for us to fix